173: /// World-space rotation-vector offset (direction is the axis, length the
174: /// angle in radians) plus its angular velocity. World-space so kicks land
175: /// without knowing the animated local frame; a fast-turning character drags
176: /// a dying wobble a few degrees off-axis for a fraction of a second.
177: #[derive(Default, Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq)]
178: struct Spring {
